<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Hyderabad to Kolkata Car Transportation Cost Estimate
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the Car Transportation Cost From Hyderabad To Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is shaped by vehicle size, carrier type (hydraulic ramp, open‑deck, or enclosed container), distance‑based base rate, fuel surcharge, tolls, GST, insurance coverage, and any special handling requirements such as extra padding for luxury cars. Seasonal demand and the chosen packers‑and‑movers also affect the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure a zero‑scratch guarantee during the Hyderabad‑to‑Kolkata move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each vehicle is loaded onto a hydraulic ramp trailer equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. The 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging—bubble wrap, foam edge protectors, corrugated sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates—protects every surface. Our drivers follow a strict no‑impact protocol, and any damage triggers immediate insurance claim processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for RTO compliance when moving a car between Hyderabad and Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need the original registration certificate, a valid insurance policy, a signed transport agreement, the e‑Way bill generated for the interstate journey, GST invoice, and a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the originating RTO. Shree Ashirwad assists in preparing and filing these documents to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the Hyderabad to Kolkata transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All Shree Ashirwad carrier trucks are fitted with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to a secure portal. Customers receive a unique tracking link and can monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations in real time, ensuring full transparency.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden surcharges or extra fees for the Hyderabad‑to‑Kolkata car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad follows a transparent pricing model. The quoted amount includes base km rate, fuel surcharge, tolls, GST, insurance, and handling fees. Optional services—such as expedited loading, additional protective crating, or after‑hour pickup—are disclosed upfront, so there are no surprise charges.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the pricing compare between hydraulic ramp carriers and open‑deck carriers on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp carriers typically command a modest premium (5‑10 %) over open‑deck carriers because they provide superior loading safety and zero‑scratch protection. However, for high‑value or delicate vehicles, the added security and insurance coverage often offset the extra cost, delivering better overall value.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
